{"suttaId":"snp4.8","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Sn","vriCode":"s0505m.mul","paras":[2835,2868],"vripara":"830"},"segments":{"snp4.8:0.2":"Pasūrasuttaṃ","snp4.8:1.1":"Idheva suddhi iti vādayanti [vidiyanti (sī. pī.)],","snp4.8:1.2":"nāññesu dhammesu visuddhimāhu;","snp4.8:1.3":"Yaṃ nissitā tattha subhaṃ vadānā,","snp4.8:1.4":"paccekasaccesu puthū niviṭṭhā.","snp4.8:2.1":"Te vādakāmā parisaṃ vigayha,","snp4.8:2.2":"bālaṃ dahantī mithu aññamaññaṃ;","snp4.8:2.3":"Vadanti te aññasitā kathojjaṃ,","snp4.8:2.4":"pasaṃsakāmā kusalā vadānā.","snp4.8:3.1":"Yutto kathāyaṃ parisāya majjhe,","snp4.8:3.2":"pasaṃsamicchaṃ vinighāti hoti;","snp4.8:3.3":"Apāhatasmiṃ pana maṅku hoti,","snp4.8:3.4":"nindāya so kuppati randhamesī.","snp4.8:4.1":"Yamassa vādaṃ parihīnamāhu,","snp4.8:4.2":"apāhataṃ pañhavimaṃsakāse;","snp4.8:4.3":"Paridevati socati hīnavādo,","snp4.8:4.4":"upaccagā manti anutthunāti.","snp4.8:5.1":"Ete vivādā samaṇesu jātā,","snp4.8:5.2":"etesu ugghāti nighāti hoti;","snp4.8:5.3":"Etampi disvā virame kathojjaṃ,","snp4.8:5.4":"na haññadatthatthipasaṃsalābhā.","snp4.8:6.1":"Pasaṃsito vā pana tattha hoti,","snp4.8:6.2":"akkhāya vādaṃ parisāya majjhe;","snp4.8:6.3":"So hassatī uṇṇamatī [unnamatī (?)] ca tena,","snp4.8:6.4":"pappuyya tamatthaṃ yathā mano ahu.","snp4.8:7.1":"Yā uṇṇatī [unnatī (?)] sāssa vighātabhūmi,","snp4.8:7.2":"mānātimānaṃ vadate paneso;","snp4.8:7.3":"Etampi disvā na vivādayetha,","snp4.8:7.4":"na hi tena suddhiṃ kusalā vadanti.","snp4.8:8.1":"Sūro yathā rājakhādāya puṭṭho,","snp4.8:8.2":"abhigajjameti paṭisūramicchaṃ;","snp4.8:8.3":"Yeneva so tena palehi sūra,","snp4.8:8.4":"pubbeva natthi yadidaṃ yudhāya.","snp4.8:9.1":"Ye diṭṭhimuggayha vivādayanti [vivādiyanti (sī. pī.)],","snp4.8:9.2":"idameva saccanti ca vādayanti;","snp4.8:9.3":"Te tvaṃ vadassū na hi tedha atthi,","snp4.8:9.4":"vādamhi jāte paṭisenikattā.","snp4.8:10.1":"Visenikatvā pana ye caranti,","snp4.8:10.2":"diṭṭhīhi diṭṭhiṃ avirujjhamānā;","snp4.8:10.3":"Tesu tvaṃ kiṃ labhetho pasūra,","snp4.8:10.4":"yesīdha natthī paramuggahītaṃ.","snp4.8:11.1":"Atha tvaṃ pavitakkamāgamā,","snp4.8:11.2":"manasā diṭṭhigatāni cintayanto;","snp4.8:11.3":"Dhonena yugaṃ samāgamā,","snp4.8:11.4":"na hi tvaṃ sakkhasi sampayātaveti.","snp4.8:11.5":"Pasūrasuttaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Pj-ii","bookName":"Suttanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0505a.att","from":2298,"to":2300,"paras":[{"para":2298,"vripara":"836-837","refs":["snp4.8:7"],"lines":["836-7. Chaṭṭhagāthāya attho – yasmā ca na haññadatthatthi pasaṃsalābhā, tasmā paramaṃ lābhaṃ labhantopi “sundaro ayan”ti <b>tattha</b> diṭṭhiyā <b>pasaṃsito vā pana hoti</b> taṃ <b>vādaṃ parisāya majjhe</b> dīpetvā, tato <b>so tena</b> jayatthena tuṭṭhiṃ vā dantavidaṃsakaṃ vā āpajjanto <b>hasati,</b> mānena ca <b>uṇṇamati</b>.","Kiṃ kāraṇaṃ?","Yasmā <b>taṃ</b> jayatthaṃ <b>pappuyya yathāmāno</b> jāto, evaṃ uṇṇamato ca <b>yā uṇṇatī</b>ti gāthā.","Tattha <b>mānātimānaṃ vadate paneso</b>ti eso pana taṃ uṇṇatiṃ “vighātabhūmī”ti abujjhamāno mānañca atimānañca vadatiyeva."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"]]},{"para":2299,"vripara":"838","refs":["snp4.8:7"],"lines":["Evaṃ vāde dosaṃ dassetvā idāni tassa vādaṃ asampaṭicchanto <b>“sūro”</b>ti gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>rājakhādāyā</b>ti rājakhādanīyena, bhattavetanenāti vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>Abhigajjameti paṭisūramicchan</b>ti yathā so paṭisūraṃ icchanto abhigajjanto eti, evaṃ diṭṭhigatiko diṭṭhigatikanti dasseti.","<b>Yeneva so, tena palehī</b>ti yena so tuyhaṃ paṭisūro, tena gaccha.","<b>Pubbeva natthi yadidaṃ yudhāyā</b>ti yaṃ pana idaṃ kilesajātaṃ yuddhāya siyā, taṃ etaṃ pubbeva natthi, bodhimūleyeva pahīnanti dasseti.","Sesagāthā pākaṭasambandhāyeva."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"]]},{"para":2300,"vripara":"839-840","refs":["snp4.8:7","snp4.8:10"],"lines":["839-40. Tattha <b>vivādayantī</b>ti vivadanti.","<b>Paṭisenikattā</b>ti paṭilomakārako.","<b>Visenikatvā</b>ti kilesasenaṃ vināsetvā.","<b>Kiṃ labhetho</b>ti paṭimallaṃ kiṃ labhissasi.","<b>Pasūrā</b>ti taṃ paribbājakaṃ ālapati.","<b>Yesīdha natthī</b>ti yesaṃ idha natthi."],"lineRefs":[["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:7"],["snp4.8:10"],["snp4.8:10"],["snp4.8:10"],["snp4.8:10"]]}],"wordLinks":[["snp4.8:7.1","yā uṇṇatī",0,2],["snp4.8:7.1","mānātimānaṃ vadate paneso",0,3],["snp4.8:10.1","visenikatvā",2,2],["snp4.8:10.3","kiṃ labhetho",2,3],["snp4.8:10.3","pasūrā",2,4],["snp4.8:10.3","yesīdha natthī",2,5]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
